stellar_core.config.performance.tConstruct.basinCastingRecipeSearchImprovements.tooltip=(Server Performance) Improvements in the search performance of Basin Casing recipes.
stellar_core.config.performance.tConstruct.tileSmelteryAlloyRecipeSearchImprovements=合金冶炼配方搜索优化
