stellar_core.config.performance.tConstruct.tileSmelteryMaxAlloyRecipePerTick.tooltip=(Server Performance) Smeltery What is the maximum number of recipes that can be completed per tick?
stellar_core.config.features.enableCustomGameTitle=启用自定义游戏标题
stellar_core.config.features.enableCustomGameTitle.tooltip=(Client) Allows you to modify the title of the game, highest priority, supports earlier versions such as CleanroomLoader 3029 (May do the same thing with other mods).
